{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '200,400p' docs/PRD.md\"","aggregated_output":"/opt/homebrew/Library/Homebrew/cmd/shellenv.sh: line 18: /bin/ps: Operation not permitted\n   - **Image Generation**: Google Nano Banana - 6 images per story = **$0.234 per story** (main cost driver)\n   - 3 core adventure templates: Superhero Rescue, Treasure Hunt, Magic Training\n   - Age-adaptive complexity: Stories automatically adjust based on user profile (5-7, 8-10, 11-12 age groups)\n   - Art style selection: Child chooses visual style per story (applies to avatar + pet)\n   - Generation time: <30 seconds from selection to story delivery\n   - **Content Strategy**: Real-time AI generation only (no template system - research shows API costs are manageable)\n   - **Cost (Customized Stories)**: 10 credits per story (~$0.42-$1.00 depending on credit package)\n   - **Cost (Generic Stories)**: FREE - 20+ generic stories always available in library\n\n**4. Credit System & Monetization**\n   - Credit balance: Family account shows shared credit pool (never expires)\n   - Credit packages: Buy credits as needed (20, 50, 100 credit packs)\n   - Transaction history: View all credit purchases and usage (purchases, stories, avatars, pets)\n   - Free stories: 20+ generic stories always available (no credits)\n   - Purchase flow: Simple 1-click purchase via Stripe, Apple Pay, or Google Play\n   - App Store integration: iOS/Android in-app purchases (30% fee)\n   - Web checkout option: Bypass app store fees for higher margins on web\n\n**5. Story Library & Viewing**\n   - Personal collection: All generated stories saved to user profile\n   - Replay capability: Re-read any previous story (does not count against monthly limit)\n   - Offline viewing: Stories cached for offline access\n   - Progress tracking: Bookmark reading position within longer stories\n   - Text-only display: Visual story scenes with text narration (voice narration post-MVP)\n\n**6. COPPA-Compliant Onboarding**\n   - Parental gate: Age verification and parental consent flow\n   - Privacy notices: Child-friendly language explaining data usage\n   - Consent mechanisms: Verifiable parental consent (credit card verification for age verification)\n   - Profile creation: Child age, preferences, reading level\n   - **Compliance focus**: No behavioral ads = simplified COPPA compliance\n\n**7. Parental Controls (Web Dashboard)**\n   - Credit management: View balance, purchase history, transaction logs\n   - Usage monitoring: Stories generated, avatars created, credit spending by child\n   - Content safety monitoring: Story history, content filtering settings, safety reports\n   - Photo deletion verification: Audit trail showing photo deletion timestamps\n   - Child profile management: Multiple child profiles per family account, age groups, preferences\n   - Spending visibility: See which children are using credits and for what (stories, avatars, pets)\n\n**8. Content Safety Infrastructure**\n   - Multi-layered filtering: AI content moderation on all generated stories\n   - Age-appropriate themes: Ensure content matches child's age group\n   - Family-friendly guarantee: No violence, mature themes, or inappropriate content\n   - Reporting mechanism: Parents can flag concerning content\n   - Quality assurance: Random story audits to ensure appropriateness\n\n**Platform Deliverables:**\n- iOS mobile app (iPhone and iPad, iOS 14+)\n- Android mobile app (phones and tablets, Android 8+)\n- Web dashboard (Next.js, responsive design for parental access and credit management)\n- Backend API services (tRPC routers running on Next.js 15 API routes)\n- Payment processing integration (Stripe for web, Apple/Google IAP for apps)\n\n### Growth Features (Post-MVP Phase 2)\n\n**Expand emotional connection and monetization:**\n\n1. **Family Voice Cloning** (Premium Tier $15/month)\n   - ElevenLabs API integration for parent voice narration\n   - 2-3 minutes of sample audio recording\n   - Voice applied to story narration with child's name pronunciation\n   - Multiple family member voices (mom, dad, grandparents)\n\n2. **Advanced Story Templates**\n   - Detective mysteries, space exploration adventures\n   - Historical adventures (meet historical figures)\n   - Environmental heroics (save the planet themes)\n   - STEM-focused adventures (science/technology integration)\n\n3. **Multiple Pet Support**\n   - Include 2-3 family pets in single story\n   - Pet interaction dynamics and relationships\n   - Choose different pets for different adventures\n\n4. **Interactive Choice Points**\n   - Simple story branching at key moments\n   - Child choices affect story direction while maintaining coherence\n   - Builds sense of agency and replayability\n\n5. **Educational Integration**\n   - Reading comprehension questions after stories\n   - Vocabulary building with word definitions\n   - Moral discussion prompts for family conversations\n   - Progress tracking aligned with literacy standards\n\n### Vision Features (Long-term)\n\n**Build interconnected story universe and platform ecosystem:**\n\n1. **Persistent Story Universe**\n   - Adventures interconnect with recurring characters\n   - Character development and growth across stories\n   - Relationships evolve (with pet companion, supporting characters)\n   - Achievement system tracking hero's journey progress\n\n2. **Global Expansion**\n   - Localized content for international markets (Spanish, French, Mandarin, etc.)\n   - Culturally authentic story themes and settings\n   - Multi-language support in apps\n\n3. **Creator Economy**\n   - Platform for professional storytellers to create templates\n   - Revenue sharing model for creator contributions\n   - Community-driven content expansion with quality controls\n\n4. **Educational Partnerships**\n   - Integration with schools and libraries for literacy programs\n   - Teacher dashboards for classroom usage\n   - Reading level assessment and progress reporting\n\n5. **Physical Product Integration**\n   - Print-on-demand books of favorite stories\n   - Merchandise featuring child's avatar and pet companion\n   - Augmented reality features (pet companion appears in real world)\n\n**Expansion Opportunities:**\n- Virtual reality storytelling experiences\n- Therapeutic applications (partnership with child psychologists for confidence-building narratives)\n- Family memory preservation platform evolution\n\n---\n\n## Mobile & Web App Specific Requirements\n\n### iOS & Android Mobile Apps (Primary Platform)\n\n**Platform Requirements:**\n- iOS 14+ (iPhone and iPad support)\n- Android 8+ (Oreo) for broad device compatibility\n- React Native for cross-platform development\n- Target devices: Phones and tablets (both orientations)\n\n**Device Features & Permissions:**\n- **Camera access**: Required for avatar and pet photo uploads\n- **Photo library access**: Alternative to camera for existing photos\n- **Local storage**: For offline story caching and avatar storage\n- **Push notifications**: For low-credit alerts and new content (opt-in)\n- **Biometric authentication**: Optional for parent dashboard access (Face ID, Touch ID, Android biometrics)\n\n**Offline Capabilities:**\n- Previously generated stories cached for offline reading\n- Avatar images stored locally\n- Story generation requires internet connection (API calls)\n- Queue story generation requests for retry when connection restored\n\n**App Store Compliance:**\n- **Age rating**: 4+ (preschool age, no objectionable content)\n- **Privacy labels**: Clearly disclose data collection for COPPA compliance\n- **In-app purchases**: Credit packs (20/50/100) with first-child free allowances\n- **Parental gate**: Compliance with Children's Category requirements\n- **No third-party advertising**: Essential for approval in Kids Category\n\n**Performance Requirements:**\n- App launch: <3 seconds on mid-range devices\n- Story generation: <30 seconds total (API call + rendering)\n- Image loading: Progressive rendering for smooth UX\n- Memory usage: <200MB to support older devices\n- Battery efficiency: Minimize background processing\n\n---\n\n### Web Dashboard (Parental Portal)\n\n**Platform:** Next.js web application, responsive design\n\n**Primary Use Cases:**\n- Subscription management (signup, billing, plan changes)\n- Multi-child profile management\n- Usage monitoring and analytics\n- COPPA compliance documentation access\n- Alternative payment flow (avoid 30% app store fee)\n\n**Required Features:**\n- Responsive design: Desktop, tablet, mobile web\n- Secure authentication: Email/password with 2FA option\n- Payment integration: Stripe for credit card processing\n- Subscription portal: Manage billing, view invoices, cancel\n- Child profiles: Add/edit multiple children, set age/preferences\n- Story history: View all stories generated by child\n- Usage dashboard: Stories this month, tier utilization\n- Privacy center: Photo deletion audit trail, data export (GDPR-K)\n\n---\n\n## User Experience Principles\n\n**Visual Personality:** Warm, magical, and inviting - a digital storybook come to life\n\n**Key Interaction Patterns:**\n\n1. **Child-First UX (In-App Experience)**\n   - Large, touch-friendly buttons and controls\n   - Minimal text (icons and images prioritized)\n   - Bright, colorful, engaging visual design\n   - No complex navigation - linear story creation flow\n   - Instant visual feedback (animations, celebrations)\n   - No ads or distractions - pure storytelling focus\n\n2. **Parent-Focused UX (Onboarding & Dashboard)**\n   - Clear, professional, trustworthy design\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
