{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_86","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,200p' PRE_DEPLOYMENT_CHECKLIST.md\"","aggregated_output":"/opt/homebrew/Library/Homebrew/cmd/shellenv.sh: line 18: /bin/ps: Operation not permitted\n# Pre-Deployment Checklist\n\n- [x] Dependencies installed (`pnpm install` successful)\n- [x] All tests passing (Fixed critical failures in AI, Validators, API, and Web packages)\n- [x] Environment variables documented (`docs/ENV_VARIABLES.md` updated)\n- [x] Security secrets identified and templated (`.env.local.template` created)\n- [x] Ready for Phase 2 (Stripe/Resend setup)\n\n## Critical Fixes Applied\n1.  **AI Package Build**: Fixed `tsconfig.build.json` to include `src/vision` folder.\n2.  **Prisma Client**: Generated Prisma client for `@herokid/database`.\n3.  **Environment Variables**:\n    *   Added missing keys to `.env.example` (`NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY`, `NANO_BANANA_API_KEY`, `TEST_DATABASE_URL`).\n    *   Created production-ready `.env.local.template`.\n    *   Documented updates in `docs/ENV_VARIABLES.md`.\n4.  **Test Fixes**:\n    *   **Validators**: Fixed `calculateAgeGroup` test flakiness in December (used `vi.useFakeTimers`).\n    *   **AI/Vision**: Fixed type errors in `qualityValidator.ts` and `safetyFilter.ts`.\n    *   **AI/Tests**: Fixed mock hoisting issues in `safetyFilter.test.ts` and `qualityValidator.test.ts`.\n    *   **AI/Tests**: Replaced `jest` with `vi` in `retry.test.ts` to match Vitest environment.\n    *   **API/AI**: Added `GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT` to test environment configuration to prevent crashes.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
